WEBVTT

00:04.350 --> 00:08.025
Meet basedb, the database for the whole team.

00:08.600 --> 00:12.641
As simple as a spreadsheet, but every field has a real type.

00:14.600 --> 00:17.392
Six views, always the same rows.

00:20.400 --> 00:25.673
The whole team, at once: comment, mention, and see it live.

00:26.450 --> 00:30.265
Forms people enjoy, and every answer becomes a row.

00:32.350 --> 00:34.280
They even turn into quizzes.

00:35.300 --> 00:37.711
Automate, without a line of code,

00:38.700 --> 00:41.448
and follow it all on live dashboards.

00:42.450 --> 00:46.123
Need a filter or a query? Just ask the AI.

00:48.450 --> 00:53.904
And under every table, a real Postgres table, open to all your tools.

00:54.450 --> 00:57.733
Free, open source, and your data stays yours.
